# Never convert line endings (2026-11-24). GitHub Pages serves the committed bytes, and sw.js holds the SHA-256 of each of them
# (the HASHES table, written by node tools/checks.mjs --bump). A checkout that turned LF into CRLF (core.autocrlf on a Windows
# machine) would make the files on disk differ from what is deployed. tools/checks.mjs asks git and fails if it would convert
# anything the app serves.
* -text
